    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abakali abakhalabamia omuruchi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luno nilwo olwanzilo lwameera kabaana baIsiraeli, abeemilisi bebilibwa, nabaseesia bebikhumila nabebikhumi, nabakali babwe abakhalabanila omuruchi, mumakhuwa kosi kemikanda echio echieenjilanga nichirula, omwesi buli mwesi, mumiesi chiosi chiomuyika, buli mukanda nikulimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusinjilili womukanda kwambeli okwomwesi kwambeli yali Yashobeamu waZabudieli; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye yali owokhubaana baFaresi, omukhulundu wabaseesia belihe bosi mumwesi kwambeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusinjilili womukanda kwomwesi kwakhabili yali Dodai omuAhohi, nomukandakwe; ' omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuseesia welihe owakhataru, owomwesi kwakhataru, yali Benaya waYehoyada omukuhani omukhulundu; mumukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila anlakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo niye Benaya tsana owali omululu owokhubalia amakhumi kataru, nasinjilila amakhumi kataru tsana; ne omwanawe Amizabadi yasinjilila omukandakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owakhane, owomwesi kwakhane, yali Asaheli omwana wabwe Yoabu, naZebadia omwanawe oumulonda; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuseesia wakharaano, owomwesi kwakharaano, yali Shamuhutsi omuIzihari; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owakhasasaba, owomwesi kwakhasasaba, yali Ira waIkeshi omuTekoa; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owomusaafu, owomwesi kwomusaafu, yali Helezi omuPeloni, owokhubaana baEfuraimu; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owomunaane, owomwesi kwomunaane, yali Sibekai omuHushatsi, owokhubaZera; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owashienda, owomwesi kwashienda, yali Abiezeri omuAnatsotsi, owokhubaBenyamini; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owekhumi, owomwesi kwekhumi, yali Maharai omuNetofatsi, owokhubaZera; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owekhumi nalulala, owomwesi kwekhumi nalulala, yali Benaya omuPiratsoni, owokhubaana baEfuraimu; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owekhumi nakhabili, owomwesi kwekhumi nakhabili, yali Heledai omuNetofatsi, waOtsinieli; omukandakwe kwalimwo abandu ebikhumila amakhumi kabili nabine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi abasinjilili betsimbia tsiaIsiraeli; mbu khubaReubeni, yaliho Eliezeri waZikhiri omwimilisi; khubaSimeoni, Shefatia waMaaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khuLawi, Hashabia waKemueli; khuHaruni, Zadoki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khuYuda, Elihu, owokhubaana babwe Daudi; khuIsakhari, Omiri waMikaeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khuZabuloni, Ishimaya waObadia; khuNafutali, Yeremotsi waAzirieli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khubaana baEfuraimu, Hoshea waAzazia; khunusu yoluyia lwaManase, Yoeli waPedaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khunusu yoluyia lwaManase muGileadi, Ido waZakaria; khuBenyamini, Yaasieli waAbineri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khuDani, Azareli waYerohamu. Abo nibo abakhulundu betsimbia tsiaIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi shiyabala abo abaleema khumiyika amakhumi kabili tashichila OMWAMI yali niyasunga mbu yakheenjiyia Isiraeli shinga tsinyininyini etsiomwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu waSeruya yachaaka okhubala, ne shiyamalilisia ta; ne khulwako oburima bweetsa khuIsiraeli; kata obunji obwo shibwayeenjisibwa mumatoonyo kamakhuwa ketsindaalo akomuruchi Daudi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusinjilili wamabiishilo komuruchi yali Azimawetsi waAdieli; nomusinjilili wamabiishilo akomutsindalo, nakomumataala, nakomubisoma, nakomutsingoba, yali Yonatsani waUzia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nomusinjilili wa abo abakholanga emilimo mumikunda, okhulima liloba, yali Eziri waKhelubu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nomusinjilili wemikunda chiemitsabibu yali Shimei omuRamatsi; nomusinjilili webio ebiarulanga mumikunda chiemitsabibu khulwa amabiishilo keidivai, yali Zabudi omuShifimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusinjilili wemitseituni nemikhuyu echiali muShefela yali Baalihanani omuGederi; nomusinjilili wamabiishilo kamafura yali Yoashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusinjilili wetsing'ombe etsiali mubwayilo eSharoni yali Shitirai omuSharoni; nomusinjilili wetsing'ombe etsiali mumabanda yali Shafati waAdilai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusinjilili wetsingamia yali Obili omuIshimaeli; nomusinjilili wetsisishili yali Yedeya omuMeroni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
