        },
        {
          "text": "Yonatsani, ousamwana Daudi, omuchesiyii, omundu wobumanyilisii, omuhandiichi, nende Yehieli waHakhimoni, bali abasinjilili babaana bomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.32",
